                            <comment id="17928304" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Wed, 19 Feb 2025 07:25:38 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The metadata file formats of Kylin4 and Kylin5 are not unified. Directly loading Kylin4 metadata files into Kylin5 may result in some files not having corresponding matches during the conversion process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Update the metadata files provided in the `sample_project` path, converting them into Kylin5-compatible metadata files.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
